     "pedagogyRole": "definition",
     "content": "To find a percentage of a quantity, write the percentage as a decimal by dividing by 100, then multiply. You may use a calculator."
    },
    {
     "id": "t3-example-1",
     "type": "worked-example",
     "pedagogyRole": "example",
     "examples": [
